WEBVTT

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.980
Jingle, jingle!

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.730
Vroom!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.500
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.500
<b>I Practiced Really Hard</b>

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.500
<b>Temporarily</b>

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.500
<b>Closed</b>

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.250
Nattsun, I came over to play!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.100
Nattsun!

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.510
No answer.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:03.220
Hey!

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.270
Hey!

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.490
That hand is talking!

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.350
I didn't know that kind of monster existed!

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:14.030
No, no, it's me. It's Konomi.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:17.320
Nacchan and her family went 
shopping, so no one's home.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.570
Really? And I came all 
the way here to play...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.780
Want to play with me, then?

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.700
Can I? Let's play, let's play!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.540
I'm coming over there now!

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.840
Konomi-nee, I'm here!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.820
Now Konomi-nee is gone.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.310
K-Konomi-nee's shell!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.020
Boo!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:46.890
What?!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.470
Th-There you are!

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.330
Sorry about that.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.440
I took my shovel inside. What's wrong?

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.410
Your shell is here.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.280
Shell?

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.280
Oh, those are vinyl gloves.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.240
I was using them to work in the garden.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.490
Oh, they're gloves?

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:08.000
I thought you had molted.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.560
What the heck?

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:13.160
Yeah, you're right. People don't molt.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.210
That would make them monsters.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.460
Monsters molt?

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:21.350
There might be monsters that molt!

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:25.510
But you're not a monster, 
so you wouldn't molt.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.970
Of course I don't molt.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.230
I am a monster, though.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:34.250
Oh, I never told you?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.650
I'm a monster.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.360
What?! That's the first I've heard that!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.700
Really? I thought everyone knew.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.090
A-Are you really a monster?!

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.960
If you are, I want to see proof!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.370
Proof?

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:53.330
Okay. Then watch my fingers.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.540
Okay! I'm watching!

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.410
Okay, watch closely.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.140
This finger...

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.130
Look! It came off!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.220
Konomi-nee's thumb came off!

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:12.080
H-Hospital! Call a doctor!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.440
Oh! I just remembered! 
I've got a band-aid today!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.400
I'll use this to operate!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.230
Thanks... But I'm fine now.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.820
What are you talking about?!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.860
If people could be "fine" after that, 
we wouldn't need... doctors...

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:25.610
Look.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:37.210
See? I healed instantly 
'cause I'm a monster.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.140
So you're really...

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:42.920
You're really the 
Doesn't-Need-Doctors Monster?!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.380
Aww, you figured it out.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.130
Wow! Wow!

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.420
I've never seen a real monster before!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.470
They really do exist!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.430
<i>This is fun.</i>

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.650
C-Can I... Can I become a monster 
like Santa Claus, too?!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:01.520
You have a very broad definition 
of "monster," don't you?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.540
It's not easy to become one, though.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.310
There's a national exam, 
so you have to study.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:09.260
I can become one by studying?!

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:12.170
Konomi-nee, teach me how to study!

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.760
I'll work hard!

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:17.120
Sure. Want to head up to my room?

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.170
Don't run. It's dangerous.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.130
Qi You   Qi guo, you ren you tian di beng zhui...

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.130
I-Is this a spell?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.720
I already found something incredible!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.890
Yeah, that book of spells might 
be a bit advanced for you.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:34.010
What?! So it really is a book of spells?

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.850
I had no idea you dabbled in 
things like this, Konomi-nee!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.730
Why don't you try studying multiplication?

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.580
Multiplication? I've heard of that.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.510
They do that in second grade.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.410
It'll be really impressive if 
you can do it in first grade.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.110
How do you multiply?

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.320
You memorize multiplication tables.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.330
2 x 3 = 6, 2 x 4 = 8, and such.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.250
That sounds hard.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.080
For 2 x 3, you can just 
add three 2s together,

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.340
but calculating it takes longer.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.550
You can just add?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.510
So 4 x 8 = 32?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.650
Huh? That's right...

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.760
Did you work that out by adding?

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:15.040
6 x 6?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.020
36.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.710
That's right! 9 x 9?

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.800
81.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.610
That's right!

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.590
I multiplied just by adding!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.310
There's a secret trick like that?!

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.890
Uh, I'm not sure I'd call it a secret trick...

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:29.410
I can tell you passed the 
monster test, Konomi-nee.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:32.260
You're really good at teaching.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.240
You might make a better 
teacher than Nee-nee.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:38.580
No, you're just really amazing.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.500
Nacchan and her family are home.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.080
I won't run this time.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.680
Good girl.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.220
Nattsun! Koma-chan! Welcome back!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.860
Hey, Ren-chon. You came to play?

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:57.840
Yep.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:01.200
I invited her to my house 
since you guys weren't home.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.710
Konomi-nee is amazing!

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.070
Her finger came off, but it healed instantly!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.170
She's the Doesn't-Need-Doctors Monster!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.940
Huh? What're you talking about?

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.970
Well, Renge-chan's reaction 
was just so funny...

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.450
Remember? I showed you this a long time ago.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.330
Oh, that?

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.190
Like this, right?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.100
My finger came off!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.170
Oh, I know that one, too.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.300
And now... it's back to normal!

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:29.730
Ren-chon?

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:39.220
I'm glad you guys aren't monsters.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.140
I'm going home now.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.730
Bye-bye.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.830
Sorry I scared you.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.970
Oh, yeah. Wanna go tomorrow to the 
mountain we went to last year?

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:50.240
Sorry, I have plans already.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.950
Oh, okay.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.450
What mountain?

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.650
Last year, Nii-chan and Nee-chan and I

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.570
went to a mountain two stations
down with really pretty fall colors.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.550
Oh, that place?

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:02.210
But the train fare...

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:04.690
We could go on our bikes.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.340
We can make it two stations down, right?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.050
Well, I guess we could make it that far...

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.880
But Renge still has training 
wheels, so it might be hard.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.010
Oh, yeah.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.470
When did you guys take off 
your training wheels?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.770
When I was in first grade, I think.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.350
Same here.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.500
You just got your bike recently, though.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.600
There's no need to take them off right away.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.410
Nee-nee! Nee-nee!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.230
Welcome home. What's the matter?

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:42.290
Well, I want you to take the 
little wheels off my bike.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.290
Oh, the training wheels? 
You're not ready for that, are you?

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.950
It'll be okay!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.770
Nattsun and Koma-chan said they 
took theirs off in first grade.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.050
I'll take mine off, too!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.170
All right, I suppose.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.930
I'll help!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.890
There.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:07.190
Nee-nee, can you help me ride it tomorrow?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:12.430
Oh, I need to go shopping tomorrow, 
so I'm going to the store.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.820
I'll help you on my next day off.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.280
Okay.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.540
Want to come to the store with me?

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.090
No. I want to ride my bike.

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:23.730
I'm going to practice.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:26.040
It's dangerous to ride it alone.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.650
Then it's okay as long as someone's with me?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.360
Well, I guess...

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:33.340
I'll find someone to help me!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:37.590
Try not to be too pushy and bother anyone.

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.600
Candy Store! Candy Store!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.020
Hey, welcome.

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.530
Candy Store, are you free right now?

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.590
What's up? You need something?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:52.260
Well, I took the little wheels off my bike.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:55.110
So I want you to watch 
while I practice riding.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:58.180
Oh... Sorry, but I'm working.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.700
I can help on my day off.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.200
Really? You can't come 
when you're done working?

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.140
I'll be working until evening.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.370
Just do it another day.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.410
Okay, then you can just 
watch me from right there.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.970
Can you do that?

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:13.380
Just watch from here?

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.210
Well, I guess...

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:19.050
Really?! Okay, I'm gonna go practice!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.480
I can't see a thing from here.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.380
Hey...

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:55.090
You okay?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.730
I can hear you falling pretty hard.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:01.170
As long as we stay in front of 
the store, I can help you...

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.580
That's okay.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:05.720
Nee-nee told me not to bother anyone.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.850
You're working, so you can just watch me.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:13.360
Well, if that's okay with you, then...

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.070
Okay, I'm gonna practice more!

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.200
Be careful.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.940
It'll be dark soon.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:47.600
It's good that you're trying so hard,
but you should head home.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.910
Hey, your knees are all scraped up.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.110
I couldn't ride my bike at all.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.210
That's how it always is at first.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:04.760
Well, it's pretty late. 
Want me to take you home?

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:08.370
That's okay. I'll go home by myself today.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:29.560
You've got a fever.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.780
Must be a cold.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.980
You'd better stay home from school today.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.190
I'll call the doctor over to see you.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:39.650
Okay.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.570
Gu's Dish

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.960
Hello, Senpai?

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:03.550
The pillow you ordered came in today.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.060
What should I do with it?

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.690
Bring it over after I close up the store?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.010
You'll come pick it up tomorrow? Okay.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.240
What? Is she okay?

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:20.130
I see. Okay, sure. See you tomorrow.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.930
I'm coming in!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:51.810
Renge! Are you... okay...?

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.390
What? You were here, Candy Store?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.270
I just got here. What are you guys doing?

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:03.780
What are we doing? Renge's sick, 
so we came to check on her.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.150
Did you come to check on Ren-chon, too?

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.910
I just happened to be in the neighborhood.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.420
Huh? You showed up in such a hurry just 
because you were in the neighborhood?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:17.490
It looks like you came to visit 
because you were worried. Right?

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:18.290
Yep.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.300
I-I was just... coming to 
deliver a pillow for Senpai.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.590
She ordered it.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.650
Aww, tomorrow would've been fine.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.930
I'll get the money for you, then.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:32.130
I'm sorry! I forgot to bring the pillow!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.010
Huh?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.460
Hey, are those snacks?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.590
Why not give them to Ren-chon, 
since you're here?

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.120
Uh... Sure.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.690
There are so many.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.590
Isn't that nice, Ren-chan?

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:45.650
Then I'll take this one and this one.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.280
Hey! I brought those for Renge!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:52.160
Oh, so you really did come 
to check on Ren-chon?

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.980
So you <i>were</i> worried about her!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:01.160
If you'd just said so in the first 
place, I wouldn't have picked on you!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.480
You're so difficult, Candy Store!

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:09.300
Komari and Hotaru-chan, 
you can eat the snacks, too.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.100
This one gets none.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.610
Aww!

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.390
Candy Store, Candy Store.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.790
Will you read me a picture book?

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.870
A picture book?

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.270
This one.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.980
<b>Japanese Folk Tales</b>

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.980
<b>The Crane Repays a Debt</b>

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.980
I've read that one to you lots of times.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.480
Also, why do you want me to do it?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.470
Hey!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:28.180
I want you to read her a picture book, too!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.950
You read it.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:29.950
Ow.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:34.350
Well, I'm going to start 
getting dinner ready.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:37.760
Ren-chon, I'll bring you some grated apples.

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.200
Ooh, apples.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.330
I'll help you. That seems like a lot of work.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.080
Thanks a lot.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:44.830
No problem.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:49.010
Are these the apples?

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:53.960
Yeah. There's a grater on the 
shelf, so you can use that.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.170
Okay.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.360
Maybe I'll make hotpot today.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.770
Thanks for having us over.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.440
Oh, thank you all for coming to see her.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.150
You're leaving already?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:12.490
Well, you came right when 
we were about to leave.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.410
Be careful getting home.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.580
We will.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.710
I brought your apples.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.800
'Kay...

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.470
<b>Japanese Folk Tales</b>

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.470
<b>The Crane Repays a Debt</b>

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:44.400
When the old man opened the door, he saw...

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.580
A crane.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.720
...a crane.

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:52.120
And with its long beak, 
the crane was weaving...

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.190
A coat.

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.860
Quit saying everything before I do.

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.290
I put Renge to bed.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.930
Oh, thanks.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:08.470
Have dinner here before you go.

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:10.300
Our parents will be home late.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.010
Okay. Anything I can help with?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.980
No, we're all good.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:18.380
If you had new stock come in today, 
you must have been up early.

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.350
You can rest until dinner's ready.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.810
Okay, I'll take you up on that.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.280
Oh, Ren-chon, you're up already?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.670
Couldn't sleep?

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.580
I came for a drink of water.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.210
Candy Store is sleeping?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.580
She had an early start this morning.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:48.330
Remember to thank her later.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.720
Hey.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.490
Dinner's ready. Wake up.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:10.370
Oh... Sorry. I was out cold.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:14.170
It's no problem. I did tell you to rest.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.150
Thanks for the coat, too.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:20.120
I didn't do that, actually.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.640
Yeah?

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:31.540
Yep.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.140
<b>Closed</b>

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:45.430
It's closed.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:48.060
Hey! I'm off today!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.260
Candy Store!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.860
That takes care of the maintenance.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.160
Renge.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.120
Ready to practice riding your bike?

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:03.900
Yes!

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.290
We're here!

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.410
Welcome. Looks like there's 
a lot of you today.

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:51.180
Ren-chon can ride her bike 
without training wheels now,

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:53.230
so we're going to ride two stations down.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.120
Oh?

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.940
We stopped here since it's on the way.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:59.650
Which candy should I get?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.690
Senpai, how about this?

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.530
Which one? Oh, yeah.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:11.750
Here, Renge. This what you wanted?

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.240
Yeah, this one.

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.920
Candy Store, thank you.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:23.420
Sure.

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.760
Thanks for stopping in!

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:29.630
All right, we bought our snacks.

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.140
Now let's take off!

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.330
Okay.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:33.240
Let's go!

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:49.200
Ren-chon, if you go too 
fast, you'll get tired!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.410
I'm okay!

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.330
I can go...

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.680
...as far as I want!

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:16.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.550
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>Mom, I'm home!</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:44.740
<i>Hotaru!</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>I Became a Pampered Child</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Nocchi

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Please Watch Again
